PAGE 2  ·  ABOUT US
PAGE HEADLINE
We're building the roads India's EVs deserve.
Vega Nrgy Private Limited is a technology led EV charging infrastructure company with a simple belief: that range anxiety on Indian highways is a solvable problem.
We're solving it with Vega Charge — a network of premium, multi-standard fast-charging stations designed for highway corridors across Telangana, Andhra Pradesh, and beyond.
OUR STORY
Why we started.
Drive an EV on a national highway in India today, and somewhere around the 150 km mark, a familiar fear kicks in. Is there a charger ahead? Will it work? What if I get stuck?
That question is what's holding back EV adoption — not the cars, not the prices, but the infrastructure gap on India's highways.
We saw that gap on NH-65. Hundreds of kilometres. Almost no reliable fast-charging options. And a massive, growing fleet of EV drivers with nowhere to stop.
So we decided to build the stops.
VisionTo be India's No.1 technology-led EV charging network — making sustainable mobility seamless, accessible, and available to all.
MissionTo build India's most trusted EV charging network, empowering every driver to travel without doubt, across every road in India.
How We Do ItBy delivering transformative, affordable, and seamless charging solutions backed by trust and reliability — empowering every driver, every business, and every community to make the shift to electric mobility.
Why We Do ItFor us, this is beyond charging — it's about building a complete EV ecosystem rooted in global standards with real local impact, across urban and rural India alike. Vega Nrgy is creating a cleaner, greener legacy, powering not just vehicles but a more sustainable future for generations to come.
BRAND DISTINCTION
Vega Nrgy is the parent company — our infrastructure, investment, and B2B identity.
Vega Charge is what you see on the highway — the stations, the experience, the brand drivers trust.
