PAGE HEADLINE
Charging stops built for the road — and the driver.
Every Vega Charge station is designed to be more than a power socket on a highway. It's a rest stop, a service point, and a community hub — built to global standards, designed for Indian conditions.
STATION FEATURES
What's at every Vega Charge station.
Fast DC Charging
3 × 120 kW DC fast chargers · CCS2, CHAdeMO, Bharat DC-001 · 100–150 km range in 30 min
Waiting Lounge
Climate-controlled · seating · wi-fi · designed for a comfortable 20–30 min break
Clean Washrooms
Maintained 24×7 · separately managed · driver and family-friendly
Children's Play Area
Safe, enclosed · so the whole family travels without stress
Commercial Zone
Café, snacks, or partner retail — amenities that make the stop worthwhile
24×7 Operation
Staffed and monitored round the clock · remote support available
[ Feature icon grid · 6 icons in 2 rows of 3 · green icon colour · navy text ]
STATION 1 — NARKETPALLE
Flagship Station: Narketpalle, NH-65
Location: NH-65, Narketpalle, Nalgonda District, Telangana
Status: Under construction — opening soon
Site area: ~2,000 sq. yards
Chargers: 3 × 120 kW DC Fast (CCS2 + CHAdeMO + Bharat DC-001)
Narketpalle sits on one of Telangana's busiest freight and passenger corridors — midway between Hyderabad and the AP border. It's the perfect first stop for India's growing EV highway network.
