PAGE 4: SOLUTIONS
SolutionsPowering Every Journey, For Every Need
1.Highway Charging
Headline: Drive Without Doubt. Every Highway. Every Time.
Vega Nrgy's flagship offering — a network of fast charging stations strategically located along India's national highway corridors, designed to eliminate range anxiety and make long-distance EV travel truly seamless.
What We Offer
120kW DC fast chargers — charge in minutes, not hours
Multi-standard compatibility: CCS2, CHAdeMO, Bharat DC-001, AC Type 2
Comfortable pitstop amenities — waiting lounge, washrooms, children's play area
Retail &amp; refreshment options at select stations
24/7 operations with technology-enabled customer support
Real-time station availability updates via app/website
Where We AreCurrently operational on NH-65 (Vijayawada–Hyderabad Corridor), with rapid expansion underway across India's national highway network.
CTA Button: Find a Charging Station →
2. Commercial Charging
Headline: Power Your Business. Charge Smarter.
Vega Nrgy's commercial charging solutions are designed for businesses looking to offer EV charging as a value-added service — whether you own a hotel, restaurant, mall, fuel station, or any commercial establishment along a highway corridor.
What We Offer
AC &amp; DC fast chargers tailored to your location and footfall
End-to-end installation, operation, and maintenance support
Real-time monitoring and remote diagnostics via our technology platform
Revenue-sharing models for host businesses
Branded charging experience aligned to your establishment
Who It's ForHotels &amp; Resorts | Fuel Stations | Shopping Centres | Highway Dhabas &amp; Rest Stops | Commercial Complexes
CTA Button: Partner With Us →
3. Fleet Operators
Headline: Keep Your Fleet Moving. Always.
For logistics companies, cab aggregators, and commercial fleet operators, downtime is cost. Vega Nrgy's fleet charging solutions are built for high-utilisation, round-the-clock operations — giving fleet managers the reliability and control they need to run an efficient electric fleet.
What We Offer
Dedicated fleet charging bays with priority access
High-speed DC fast charging for minimum turnaround time
Fleet management dashboard — track charging sessions, costs, and energy consumption in real time
Flexible billing — per unit, monthly, or contract-based plans
Volume-based rate agreements
ToD-optimised pricing
Multi-vehicle simultaneous charging capability
Who It's ForLogistics &amp; Delivery Fleets | Cab &amp; Ride-share Operators | Corporate Employee Transport | Government &amp; Municipal Fleets
